{"synopsis":"Hua Tuo, tabib legendaris dari akhir Dinasti Han, tiba-tiba dirasuki oleh seorang dokter magang dari dunia modern! “Sombong banget.” Hua Tuo, yang dikenal sebagai Dokter Ilahi, ternyata nggak mati di penjara karena kutukan Cao Cao… “Aku… masih hidup?” Saat dia membuka matanya dalam rasa sakit yang luar biasa, yang dia lihat adalah… benda-benda aneh dan pesan-pesan yang nggak pernah dia lihat sebelumnya! “Apa-apaan ini? Jangan-jangan… aku masuk ke tubuh dokter dari dunia lain?” Ingatan pemilik tubuh ini, Lee Min-ho, langsung membanjiri pikirannya. Dunia ini emang beda banget… tapi masa iya dunia kayak gini beneran ada?! “Siapa yang nyeret aku ke dalam tubuh anak muda ini, hah?”","alternative_title":"외과 의사가 된 화타","author":"Park Dong-Shin","artist":"Contimaker Studio, Gogo Comics, Kalkanama, Night Sky","chapters":[{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"a27626ed-b948-48e9-98e3-642f10d00502","date":"2026-01-25","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"1a2103b5-61ce-4058-9fee-ef42b9b59e7f","date":"2026-01-18","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"93f3715e-d2b0-4094-94d3-abbea49a575d","date":"2026-01-11","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"b5e23a9d-1830-4934-bc31-3a6ea6f652cd","date":"2026-01-05","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"cfcde9b6-89db-4f8d-9506-24e8891186aa","date":"2025-12-28","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"a47d1d4a-a546-4d16-9be4-1ec149c1c1e2","date":"2025-12-21","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"75fff488-1c2d-497c-9dd3-31c57ebcc1d5","date":"2025-12-14","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"c01f4506-cfcb-4910-bbfc-f0f8868d514f","date":"2025-12-07","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"5e248e51-8be3-4e25-b586-c96386defb68","date":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"1fcc502d-d790-49e3-9ec2-f00390a87018","date":"2025-11-23","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"07181ad9-b842-4f86-a5d5-a1174b1f0b87